# Hual04c first input route (UU/seconds): opening cable-car ride, then jump to the
# cabin rope ladder. No teleports, grants, goal writes or control overrides.
# The game's HUD finishes its own slide-out and emits EndCartoonEffect; Telepherique0
# rides to its first point, explodes and returns control at ~24.983 s.
# Jump before crossing the open floor trap: walking off drops ~2000 UU (-114 HP).
# Measured blocker: the ladder catches the box on its eastern edge at
# (-1062.276,53.756,19.680). Upward input requests 200 UU/s but the box sweep hits
# XIIIMover6 (Telephstatic.TL_boitecorde). After that part is destroyed during the
# car's fall (~70 s), climbing advances to z=46.380 and stalls against
# TelepheriquePoint0 (Telephstatic.TLcabine) through 119.9 s.
# Crouching was also tried and produces the same pin (crouch is disabled on ladders).
# Keep trying until 119.9 s, then wait for travel to pin the surviving partial route.
# Goals 0/2/3 and kello01a travel remain unreached; completed goals 1/4/5/6 are
# authored anti-goals, not accomplishments of this route.
t=0.50 goto -3200 128
t=3.00 forward 0
t=26.00 goto -1100 70
t=26.00 jump
t=26.30 yaw -90
t=26.30 pitch 60
t=26.30 forward 1
t=26.30 right 1
t=27.00 right 0
t=119.90 wait_travel
